### Test Book Store API
### Base URL: http://localhost:3226

### 1. Seed Database - Insert 10 books (including John Smith with 5 books)
POST http://localhost:3226/books/seed
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Books
GET http://localhost:3226/books

###

### 3. Create a New Book
POST http://localhost:3226/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Programming Book",
  "author_first_name": "Test",
  "author_last_name": "Author",
  "publishing_year": 2026,
  "category": "Technology",
  "num_of_favorites": 50,
  "description": "Test description",
  "isbn": "978-9999999999"
}

###

### QUERY 1: Books Created This Year (2026)
GET http://localhost:3226/books/query/created-this-year

###

### QUERY 2: Authors with At Least 5 Books
GET http://localhost:3226/books/query/authors-with-5-books

###

### QUERY 3: Programming Books in Technology Category
GET http://localhost:3226/books/query/programming-technology

###

### QUERY 4: Books with Specific Fields (id, title, author_full_name, publishing_year, num_of_favorites)
GET http://localhost:3226/books/query/specific-fields

###

### Get Book by ID (replace :id with actual book ID)
GET http://localhost:3226/books/65c123456789abcdef123456

###

### Update Book (replace :id with actual book ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3226/books/65c123456789abcdef123456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "num_of_favorites": 500
}

###

### Delete Book (replace :id with actual book ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3226/books/65c123456789abcdef123456

###
